= Piłsudski leaves

Józef Piłsudski has resigned his last military function and, in the hotel Bristol, taken his leave of politics, attacking the right and its press. He has settled in Sulejówek, and his followers in the army and in the party wait for what we will say.

- @farewell
- @silent

@farewell
title: Take leave of the Marshal with respect
subtitle: The Piłsudczycy in the party are pleased (−5), but the Centre sees it as homage to an opponent of the Sejm.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_dep_result = PolishPolitics.departureChoose(Q, 'farewell');
!}
